{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0119_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0119_story_05_title", "source_sha256": "c72f83d91b054cb13f84c1f23437930e68ee64def43e091125c0d5507a78c63c", "ja": "君がため　優しい微笑み　両どなり", "zh": "为你绽放　温柔微笑　在身旁两侧", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0119_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0119_story_05_synopsis", "source_sha256": "1a248e403868757489a11812ad1d4f8f5d25f17f4549c837c09c31d37a0ff40d", "ja": "オフの日も自主練をしにきたエミリーを諭す\nプロデューサー。なぜ英国人の自分を選んで\nくれたのかと言うエミリーに、だからこそわ\nかる事もあると語る。やがて紬と朋花も自主\n練に来て、全員で甘味処に行くのだった。", "zh": "劝说休息日也来进行自主练习的艾米莉的制作人。面对艾米莉询问为什么会选中身为英国人的自己，制作人说道，正因为如此，才有些事情能够理解。后来纺和朋花也来进行自主练习，大家一起去了甜品店。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0119_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0119_story_05_1000_p", "source_sha256": "fa6d8fa1f1456105eb00b1af56171fd5603115d12eb23bbcf75b2feb065843b7", "ja": "（和風ユニットのレッスンは、順調に進んでいる。\n今日はオフだから、しっかり休んでくれるといいな）", "zh": "（和风组合的练习进展顺利。今天是休息日，希望能好好休息）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0119_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0119_story_05_1001_032emi", "source_sha256": "8d7210320940866ae65fc3ff643fb8b9c7b713321d79dac2ff4bec339a8a7761", "ja": "仕掛け人さま、お疲れさまです。", "zh": "策划人，辛苦了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0119_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0119_story_05_1002_p", "source_sha256": "6e1c7c5e752b5733f5696cc296ad5bf6bc7f6b95c9cf890c2b00cd204f972507", "ja": "あれっ？　エミリー、お疲れさま。\nオフなのに、どうして劇場にいるんだ？", "zh": "哎？艾米莉，辛苦了。\n明明今天休息，怎么会在剧场呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0119_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0119_story_05_1003_032emi", "source_sha256": "4188a8f07f6b61f6bda5289c7d35cc09f4085d65e4717b1d0470fb54736cdeef", "ja": "あの……私、紬さんや朋花さんのような雅さには、\nまだ足りない気がして。自主練習をしようかと……。", "zh": "那个……我觉得自己还不够具备像紬小姐和朋花小姐那样的优雅气质。所以想来进行自主练习……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0119_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0119_story_05_1004_p", "source_sha256": "3412759bdb86dfd4c8f41b94588830e4e5332aed6916ece005cfd30843f3d226", "ja": "自主練習か……できれば休んでほしいんだけどな。\nレッスンと同じくらい、休養も大事なんだし。", "zh": "自主练习啊……可以的话，我倒是希望你休息一下。休养和课程一样重要嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0119_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0119_story_05_1005_032emi", "source_sha256": "8b3ed0f40a4c4a175fbf0729a3bf64bd78c984b23f47e19a9924e52f7c9af06d", "ja": "そ、そうですか。すこしでも上達しないと、\nおふたりと差がついてしまうかと思ったのですが……。", "zh": "这、这样啊。可要是不多少进步一点，我担心会被你们两位越甩越远……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0119_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0119_story_05_1006_032emi", "source_sha256": "560d68ada3fc503ee850ae8f200554301c4fa1f3f68bcf771aeb9ae9b77b0f4d", "ja": "でも仕掛け人さまがそう仰るなら、わかりました。\n今日のところは、休むことにいたします！", "zh": "不过既然制作人这么说，那我明白了。今天就先休息吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0119_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0119_story_05_1007_p", "source_sha256": "014e125a5479edb15e01fb3cb1b477595e21e5bd2797f4f7bd4b3a425e222b1a", "ja": "ずいぶんやる気なんだな、エミリー。\nやっぱり、和風のユニットだからか？", "zh": "干劲十足嘛，艾米莉。\n果然是因为这是和风组合吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0119_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0119_story_05_1008_032emi", "source_sha256": "688d49dae56ffa23b4c19dad4d1fade7ef6e69a3f34735e02a93764d7ec2823d", "ja": "それもあります！　……ですがそれ以上に、\n紬さん、朋花さんとご一緒なので……。", "zh": "确实也有这个原因！……不过更重要的是，因为能和紬小姐、朋花小姐一起……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0119_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0119_story_05_1009_032emi", "source_sha256": "15a597c443d475345fd613e2ec15a916e8d08e49aad15910318ebfe736e75887", "ja": "おふたりと和の心を表現するには、大和撫子として\nもっと精進しないと、見劣りしてしまいそうで。", "zh": "要和两位一起展现和风之心的话，作为大和抚子，我还得更加精进才行，不然似乎会显得逊色。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0119_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0119_story_05_1010_p", "source_sha256": "18c63fc26992203b62cec6064bca899de6c989c3dc76963c0b14a7afc02410c7", "ja": "そんなに気負わなくても……\nエミリーは十分、大和撫子らしいと思うけどな。", "zh": "不用这么勉强自己……\n我觉得艾米莉已经很有大和抚子的风范了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0119_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0119_story_05_1011_032emi", "source_sha256": "637f0a56af1eb954b7fb4aeffc31343c58d2479751094ae3bc3502658df53889", "ja": "あの……仕掛け人さま？\nそのことなんですけれども……。", "zh": "那个……制作人大人？\n关于那件事……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0119_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0119_story_05_1012_032emi", "source_sha256": "36e89b89b5c55e05ab9dce08b231af853d20f37d76e8c73e93571a0cf803c396", "ja": "どうして今回、英国人の私を、\n和風の集団に選んでくださったのですか？", "zh": "这次为什么会选身为英国人的我，加入和风团体呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0119_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0119_story_05_1013_032emi", "source_sha256": "41c231e141196d8d7378dfe7b25e099d139ab754f9ef0aa9f62a5776a6dfbfba", "ja": "私は日本や和の文化に憧れていますが、紬さんや\n朋花さんのように自然な知識は持っていませんし……。", "zh": "我虽然憧憬日本和日本文化，却不像紬小姐和朋花小姐那样，拥有自然而然掌握的相关知识……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0119_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0119_story_05_1014_p", "source_sha256": "65f0081d1d0aa1896f2999792ec0ed90e8046a976e747ce29ff68f45d5adcf00", "ja": "そうだな。確かにエミリーはイギリス出身だ。ふたりの\nようにはいかないところも、あるかもしれない。", "zh": "是啊。确实，艾米莉是英国出身的。或许也有没法像你们两位那样的地方。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0119_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0119_story_05_1015", "source_sha256": "df5ac9b0796ab3aaee5c8febd298db7f4eaf7bee4d0b5d2b89f289908a75c8e9", "ja": "だからこそ！", "zh": "正因如此！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0119_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0119_story_05_2000_p", "source_sha256": "820f27d4eade731d442bf5c7b0817251be47654d8b96949f3ed65f21d8e2fabd", "ja": "でも、大和撫子に憧れるエミリーだからこそ……\n今回のユニットに、ぴったりだと思ってる。", "zh": "可是，正因为艾米莉憧憬着大和抚子……我才觉得她特别适合这次的组合。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0119_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0119_story_05_2001_032emi", "source_sha256": "3f56b17a9975991b2c91ab4a85b13e51964e5d60971d8092051fb4a0568652f7", "ja": "英国人の、私だからこそ……？", "zh": "正因为我是英国人……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0119_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0119_story_05_2002_p", "source_sha256": "31627bab3a1c783c398817367631f1bec8c4e505ef645be7b50678dba0c32ef1", "ja": "紬も朋花も、小さい頃から和に親しんでる。\nけど慣れすぎて、逆に気づかない事もあると思うんだ。", "zh": "紬和朋花从小就熟悉日本文化。可是也正因为太习惯了，我觉得有些事情反而会注意不到。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0119_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0119_story_05_2003_032emi", "source_sha256": "ad81ef4394c7d68be0222fcb8c3f228cbf34b5e24b3e26b5583af575bbfeaa7d", "ja": "慣れすぎて……気づかないこと……。", "zh": "太习惯了……反而会注意不到一些事情……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0119_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0119_story_05_2004_p", "source_sha256": "8c07958b11d6c93bc946722becf8f36a60845eef1cfbf532a442f027731772cd", "ja": "エミリーは今回のユニット活動で、紬と朋花の\n良いところをたくさん見てきたと思うんだけど……。", "zh": "我想，艾米莉在这次的组合活动中，应该发现了纺和朋花身上许多优点……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0119_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0119_story_05_2005_032emi", "source_sha256": "adc1ef7d7e6348d914ae94ae594b3ea43578f6d32f50269ee978a8a582269397", "ja": "は、はいっ！\nおふたりの良いところ、存じているつもりです！", "zh": "是、是的！\n两位的优点，我自认为都了解！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0119_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0119_story_05_2006_p", "source_sha256": "97cf5c58eaea9a8a41b5ee8566cee52adfa5b83ec3f2e5e23a8b00585675869e", "ja": "そんな風に、近くで見ているからこそわかる良さも\nユニットの魅力として、エミリーに伝えてほしいんだ。", "zh": "正因为一直在近距离观察，才更能了解她们的优点。我也希望你能把这些优点作为组合的魅力，告诉艾米莉。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0119_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0119_story_05_2007_032emi", "source_sha256": "b709e9d1d349cee2d5e431417e2e08f3e253fe6b56b4fd2c9146af22828cd7ac", "ja": "仕掛け人さま……かしこまりました！\nそれが、私のお役目なのですね！", "zh": "制作人……明白了！这就是我的职责所在，对吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0119_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0119_story_05_2008_032emi", "source_sha256": "b0e4cc339484ea43091521c5ec7b496d813a582bcada1a055ccc02a309d5c919", "ja": "紬さんや朋花さんが自然に身につけていらっしゃる\n和の心……必ず、ごヒイキ様方に伝えてみせます！", "zh": "纺织小姐和朋花小姐自然而然便已掌握的和之心……我一定会把它传达给各位贵客的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0119_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0119_story_05_2009_se", "source_sha256": "ab891e62578da72bb10899bd83d3ea003f20decf24b49e30ef768308acd59625", "ja": "カチャ", "zh": "喀嚓", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0119_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0119_story_05_2010_051tmg", "source_sha256": "a340fe8f5ebc12b1118a0ea371bc7374c6a25eb2c2323dcb6fdac3670a359260", "ja": "失礼します。{$P$}、\nすこし相談したいことが……え？", "zh": "打扰了。{$P$}，\n我有点事想找您商量……咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0119_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0119_story_05_2011_031tom", "source_sha256": "eee0c08836ece1cad8b44fdebe3d0e5fc99335eeb91dd6354b57cb3f52b56e16", "ja": "あら……\nエミリーちゃんも、劇場に来ていたんですか～？", "zh": "哎呀……\n艾米莉也来剧场了吗～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0119_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0119_story_05_2012_032emi", "source_sha256": "aa950c89b06a8d3889e23c70dc25b5fcda8df98137f48565a4b472550a765cc8", "ja": "朋花さん、紬さん！", "zh": "朋花、紬！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0119_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0119_story_05_2013_p", "source_sha256": "91a3bbb6320e9dc2955705cf6e61a2ff17455229ed625f9a27e60c9affe6cc14", "ja": "紬、朋花。ふたりも来たのか？\nまさか、自主練習をしに来たんじゃ……。", "zh": "紬、朋花，你们两个也来了吗？难道是来进行自主练习的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0119_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0119_story_05_2014_051tmg", "source_sha256": "464ca99c40b467ed615c9310d0a072f851526237e7bfd5c9bd0e8e150f39a8b9", "ja": "ええ。入り口で天空橋さんと会ったので、\n一緒にここまで……。", "zh": "是的。我们在入口遇到了天空桥小姐，就一起到这里来了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0119_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0119_story_05_2015_031tom", "source_sha256": "f5e829d1875a16ed23c8ef2a5b4b9e6f8cdfbf661d2753434173340ca2f2f060", "ja": "もしかして、エミリーちゃんもですか～？", "zh": "难道艾米莉也在吗～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0119_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0119_story_05_2016_032emi", "source_sha256": "90c8e874721405d7c758adbb510cada69e586fa3752eb62bca777e4a3057018a", "ja": "ふふっ……はい！　そうなんです。\nでも、仕掛け人さまに止められてしまいました♪", "zh": "呵呵……是的！就是这样。\n不过，被制作人先生阻止了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0119_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0119_story_05_2017_p", "source_sha256": "52109e7f5cabbc5372c36413a029267803f1751f5e1dd8a90367a663809743b4", "ja": "とにかく、今日は全員お休みだ！\nその代わり……そうだな、甘味処にでも行こうか？", "zh": "总之，今天所有人都休息！\n作为补偿……对了，要不要去甜品店？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0119_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0119_story_05_2018_051tmg", "source_sha256": "09bec229e522133fd0de81b131366b0b8b51dbb6af143ffe6c03e5294f6fc37b", "ja": "えっ、甘味処？　そんな……公演前だというのに、\nあなたは私たちを太らせようというのですか……？", "zh": "诶，甜品店？怎么这样……明明马上就要公演了，您是想让我们长胖吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0119_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0119_story_05_2019_031tom", "source_sha256": "ff1b634f71e792418af9d4fef5ed23ce4e5d12efea5c72ccbde440c3cb74909f", "ja": "衣装が入らなくなったら、\n{$P$}さんのせいですね～。", "zh": "如果衣服穿不下了，那可都是{$P$}先生的错呢～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0119_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0119_story_05_2020_032emi", "source_sha256": "c0c70fc7525a8d30ce8827039fa930d0b97ff0ad21216bb9bcd21fe40f641b12", "ja": "いえ、和菓子は熱量が少ないので、きっと大丈夫です！\nおふたりとも、参りましょう♪", "zh": "不，和果子的热量比较低，肯定没问题的！\n两位，我们走吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0119_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0119_story_05_2021_p", "source_sha256": "9ed6b37d1787c44c17809a0c6b4d3aac460b32efd790f0c3734dc5631ca3ec6a", "ja": "（3人の絆は、どんどん深まっているようだな。\nこれならきっと大丈夫だ。公演も……カロリーも！）", "zh": "（3人的羁绊似乎越来越深了。这样一来肯定没问题。无论是公演……还是卡路里！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
